express — HTTP server for login and fetching rooms/history
socket.io — real-time WebSocket messaging
better-sqlite3 — the database, stored as a single file (no DB server to install; easy to swap for Postgres later when you deploy)
bcrypt — password hashing
jsonwebtoken — session tokens after login
cors — lets the app talk to the server during development
nodemon — auto-restarts the server when you save changes


* required dependecies
npm install express socket.io better-sqlite3 bcrypt jsonwebtoken cors
npm install --save-dev nodemon

